# Build context for the Dockerfile: only what builds the page and the server.
# Nothing else - manifests, modules, the toolchain submodule, node_modules,
# a local dist/ - reaches the image.
*
!package.json
!bun.lock
!bunfig.toml
!tsconfig.json
!build.ts
!index.html
!server.ts
!src/
